======================================================================
Metric: Percentage Share of sales
Description: Calculates the proportion of sales volume relative to total selected volume (returns BLANK if no sales)
======================================================================
Percentage Share of sales = 
DIVIDE(
    [Gross Sales Volume],
    [Strict Sales]
)

======================================================================
Metric: Return Rate
Description: Calculates the percentage of returned units relative to total gross sales volume
======================================================================
Return Rate = 
VAR _ReturnRate = 
    DIVIDE(
        [Returned Units], 
        [Gross Sales Volume]
    )
RETURN 
    ABS(_ReturnRate)

